en":"But the one who was freed and remembered after a time said, \"I will inform you of its interpretation, so send me forth"}},{"ar":"نَجِيّ","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"confidant; private consultation","word":null,"ex":{"s":19,"a":52,"p":7,"ar":["وَنَـٰدَيْنَـٰهُ","مِن","جَانِبِ","ٱلطُّورِ","ٱلْأَيْمَنِ","وَقَرَّبْنَـٰهُ","نَجِيًّا"],"en":"And We called him from the side of the mount at [his] right and brought him near, confiding [to him]"}},{"ar":"نَاج","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"saved, one who escapes","word":null,"ex":{"s":12,"a":42,"p":5,"ar":["وَقَالَ","لِلَّذِى","ظَنَّ","أَنَّهُۥ","نَاجٍ","مِّنْهُمَا","ٱذْكُرْنِى","عِندَ","رَبِّكَ","فَأَنسَىٰهُ","ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","ذِكْرَ","رَبِّهِۦ","فَلَبِثَ","فِى","ٱلسِّجْنِ","بِضْعَ","سِنِينَ"],"en":"And he said to the one whom he knew would go free, \"Mention me before your master.\" But Satan made him forget the mention [to] his master, and Joseph remained in prison several years"}},{"ar":"نَٰجَيْ","kind":"verb","form":3,"count":1,"gloss":"to consult privately","word":null,"ex":{"s":58,"a":12,"p":5,"ar":["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","إِذَا","نَـٰجَيْتُمُ","ٱلرَّسُولَ","فَقَدِّمُوا۟","بَيْنَ","يَدَىْ","نَجْوَىٰكُمْ","صَدَقَةً ۚ","ذَٰلِكَ","خَيْرٌ","لَّكُمْ","وَأَطْهَرُ ۚ","فَإِن","لَّمْ","تَجِدُوا۟","فَإِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","غَفُورٌ","رَّحِيمٌ"],"en":"O you who have believed, when you [wish to] privately consult the Messenger, present before your consultation a charity. That is better for you and purer. But if you find not [the means] - then indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful"}},{"ar":"نَّجَوٰة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"Salvation, deliverance","word":"93","ex":{"s":40,"a":41,"p":6,"ar":["وَيَـٰقَوْمِ","مَا","لِىٓ","أَدْعُوكُمْ","إِلَى","ٱلنَّجَوٰةِ","وَتَدْعُونَنِىٓ","إِلَى","ٱلنَّارِ"],"en":"And O my people, how is it that I invite you to salvation while you invite me to the Fire"}}],"surahs":[[58,10],[10,7],[21,7],[7,6],[11,5],[26,5],[29,5],